    "codeLanguage": "javascript",
    "title": "Discovering Types",
    "descriptionContent": "Learn about the different types of values we can store in variables.",
    "shortDescriptionContent": "",
    "showInTrack": true,
    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17174,
        "title": "Types",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145363,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We've already seen and used a lot of different kinds of values. In programming lingo, these different kind of values are called <strong>types</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145364,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Strings are characters between quotes <code>\" \"</code>, like the value <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"42\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;PlayerOne&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerName);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"PlayerOne\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145365,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><strong>Number</strong> is another type we've already used. It represents numerical values like <code>100</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerHealth = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerHealth);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145366,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>The type <strong>boolean</strong> contains only two values: the special values <code>true</code> and <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isGameOver = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isGameOver);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145367,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When storing <code>false</code> in <code>isPaused</code> we say that we <strong>assign</strong> a value to a variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"49\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>isPaused</code>, followed by <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145368,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are values like booleans, strings, and numbers called?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Types</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Variables</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick Types.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145369,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>How do we recognize values of type <strong>string</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">By the quotes <code>\" \"</code> surrounding them </item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">By the fact that they're always words or letters</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">By the quotes <code>\" \"</code> surrounding them .</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145370,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which value is of type <strong>number</strong>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>100</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"100\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>100</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145371,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What are the <strong>boolean</strong> values?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>true</code> and <code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"True\"</code> and <code>\"False\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>true</code> and <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145372,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is a variable assignment?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Storing a value inside a variable</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Giving a variable a name</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Storing a value inside a variable.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145373,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assign a <strong>string</strong> to the <code>levelName</code> variable, a <strong>number</strong> to <code>score</code>, and a <strong>boolean</strong> to <code>hasKey</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"null\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" levelName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Forest&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"2800\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hasKey = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(levelName, score, hasKey);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"Forest\"</code>, followed by <code>2800</code>, and finally <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145374,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Save a <strong>string</strong> value into the variable <code>enemyType</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyType = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyType);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"Slime\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145375,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Save a <strong>number</strong> value into the variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" livesLeft = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(livesLeft);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>livesLeft</code>, followed by <code>3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145376,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Give <code>isPaused</code> the <strong>boolean</strong> value <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(isPaused);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145377,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Assign the value <code>57</code> to the <code>const</code> variable <code>enemyCount</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fifty-seven&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"21\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyCount = \" /><text value=\"57\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemyCount);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>const</code> followed by <code>enemyCount</code> and then <code>=</code>, <code>57</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17176,
        "title": "Working with types",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145379,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>+</code> is the joining or adding sign. In games, we often add numbers (like damage) and also join strings (like UI text).</p><p>When joining two values, we can get different results depending on their types.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;10&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145380,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>When joining numbers with strings, the number will be automatically transformed into a string.</p><p>Join the values and take a look at the resulting string for a game UI message.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;+&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;HP: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145381,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Combine a string and a number to display a player's score.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;99&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"29\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>99</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145382,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adding a number to a string also works when we use a variable like <code>score</code> that stores a number, instead of a numeric value.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"result\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"50\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Score: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + score;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>score</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145383,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>We can also join strings and booleans.</p><p>Combine a string and a boolean to display a game state flag. Is the player alive?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;true&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"38\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Again, adding a boolean to a string also works when we use a variable like <code>isPaused</code> that stores a boolean.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;pass&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" isPaused = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paused: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + isPaused;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(result);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>isPaused</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Which sign do we use to add or join two values?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>+</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What type is the result of joining a string with a number?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">number</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>10 damage</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>10 \"damage\"</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>10 damage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?<br /></p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" level = \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" label = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Level &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(label);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Level 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>levelLevel</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Level 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145389,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What is the result of joining a string and a boolean?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">A string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">A boolean</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">A string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145390,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>What does this code display in the console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Boss defeated: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Boss defeated: true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145391,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add the number values to get the final score of the player.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" finalScore = \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(finalScore);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to type <code>+</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 145392,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a string value to the numerical value and check out the string result for a game HUD.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot; coins&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>+</code>, followed by <code>\" coins\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 145393,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Add a number value to the string.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;2&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Level: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>+</code>, followed by <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 145394,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Code the string value, then add the number variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;fee&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scoreBonus = \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Bonus: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + scoreBonus);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Make sure to pick <code>\"Bonus: \"</code>, followed by <code>+</code>, and finally <code>scoreBonus</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 145395,
